*.swp

# Vector maps are tracked on purpose: they are plain-text GenBank built by
# tools/build_vector_maps.py, and the test suite designs into them.

# Local tooling writes files into the working directory that are not part
# of the package. Two have already turned up in a `git add -A`: a uv lock
# file (clonewright has no dependencies to lock, and a 500-line lock
# pinning the optional `agent` extra misrepresents that) and PyCharm's MCP
# server config, which points at a port on this machine.
uv.lock
.mcp.json
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider*
